  "text": "QR ADMIN\nYour restaurant workspace\nUI Audit Owner A\nBranch\nAll restaurant\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nUI Audit Second Branch A\nSign out\nRestaurant workspace\nShow advanced tools\nLAUNCH SETUP\nGuided Menu Setup\nPayment Acceptance\nTables & QR\nPayment Settings\nOrdering Rules\nINSIGHTS\nCollection Reconciliation\nAnalytics\nLIVE OPERATIONS\nPickup Calendar\nOverview\nQR Orders\nService Requests\nBRANDING\nQR Print Packs\nCustomer Branding\nMENU & GUESTS\nCustomers & Loyalty\nMenu & Availability\nADVANCED CONFIGURATION\nAdvanced Features\nQR Ordering license active\nJAMANVAAR QR · 12/11/2026\nLicenses and device access are managed by your platform administrator.\nProduct website\nQR ORDERING / LAUNCH SETUP\nPayment Acceptance\n\nCheck configuration and record a real phone checkout against verified payment.\n\nEnabled\nOnline payment acceptance\n\nConfiguration readiness and an actual phone checkout are separate checks. Run a small order through your normal table QR, pay on the phone, return and verify that the same order reaches the kitchen.\n\n1. Check your payment configuration\n\nReady: QR Ordering license\n\nReady: A usable payment method\n\nReady: Online payment readiness\n\nOpen payment settings\n2. Test on your actual phone\n\nOpen or scan one of these active table links. This creates a real order only when you submit checkout; it can charge your chosen amount.\n\nTable UI01\n3. Record verified acceptance\nServer-confirmed online order\nSelect paid test order\n\nNo confirmed online order in this scope yet. Cash or pending orders cannot certify online checkout.\n\n Payment app / checkout worked on the phone\n Phone returned and displayed the verified payment result\n Same order appeared in POS / KDS\nAcceptance notesRecord acceptance\nRefresh payment readiness",
